  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kemikalieinspektionen, Designst&#xf6;d Moldavien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Chemicals Agency - Design support Moldova - Swedish Chemicals Agency Design support Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design support with the aim to develop a proposal for a multi-year cooperation with the Ministry of Environment in Moldova regarding Chemicals management.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Designst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r utvecklande av f&#xf6;rslag till fler&#xe5;rig insats f&#xf6;r myndighetssamarbete mellan Kemikalieinspektionen och det moldaviska milj&#xf6;ministeriet f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till EU-anpassning av kemikaliehanteringen i Moldavien.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Project is to assess the capacities within specific ministries, to carry out a bilateral project in collaboration with KEMI. The aim is also, based on this assessment, to prepare an application for a potential multiyear cooperation project for support in Moldova&quot;s EU approximation process.</narrative>
  </description>
